WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.696 --> 00:00:21.414
A backup is made on the iPad every day, by itself.

2
00:00:21.414 --> 00:00:28.005
But a backup on the iPad does not help if the iPad is gone.

3
00:00:28.005 --> 00:00:34.443
Open Settings from the kiosk.

4
00:00:34.443 --> 00:00:39.754
Everything to do with your data is under Data.

5
00:00:39.754 --> 00:00:46.432
Turn on Copy Backup to iCloud.

6
00:00:46.432 --> 00:00:53.950
The copy is encrypted with your instructor PIN before it leaves the iPad.

7
00:00:53.950 --> 00:01:01.298
It goes to your own iCloud account — not to us. We cannot read it.

8
00:01:01.298 --> 00:01:10.560
Back Up Now sends one immediately, rather than waiting for tomorrow.

9
00:01:10.560 --> 00:01:18.467
Keep the iPad on Wi-Fi until it says the copy is in iCloud.
